e,"boundaries_approximate":false,"piece_format":"native_vocabulary_piece","decoded_text":"Саб иабду Риза ақыҭа деиҳабын, иажәа акрылнадо дыҟан. Ҳаиҳабацәа иаҳдырбаз апатуеиқәҵара ҳаԥсы ахьынӡаҭоу иҳацзар ҳҭахуп\", - иҳәеит Ҳақан, аԥсуара аӡбахә дазааҭгыло.\nҲақан Гочуа излаиԥҳьаӡо ала, аԥсҭазаара уара унапала иурԥшӡароуп, аҭаацәара рыҩнуҵҟаҿы рхатә усқәа дара-дара шалацәажәо еиԥш, аҳәынҭқаррагьы ажәлар рхатәымчқәа рыла рыхшыҩ еилаҵаны иныҟәыргароуп, анаҩс ауп анаԥшцәагьы ҳаҭырла ианҳазныҟәо.","measurement_context":null,"character_measurement":null,"roundtrip_exact":true},{"id":"fineweb-ace-0008","collection":"dataset/fineweb/ace.jsonl","text":"Hana mumada nyan, si Zulkarnen dipeugah cit meunyo meunang kalinyoe lom, zina kajeut pubut di Indonesia dan pomerintah akan dibri kondom pre keu ureung meuzina.\n“Han meumada lake meu’ah. Jih wajeb peuteupat haba hana beutoi nyan,” kheun Usman Kansong lam basa toko, Rabu (13/3/2019).\nDipeugah le si Usman, pu nyang dipeugah le si Zulkarnen bahwa lam RUU PKS, Pomerintah akan dipeuhaleu zina, nakeuh ka ditamong lam video dan ka dibagi uleh jai that ureung. Ateuh nyan keuh, Zulkarnen wajeb jak tron u lapangan, jak peuteupat bak ureung rame bahwa nyang jih peugah nyan hana beutoi.\n“Pak Zul haruih jak u lapangan peugah bak mandum ureung bahwa jih kadipeugah haba ok. Han meumada ngon media sosial di internet,” kheun Usman.\nDipeugah lom uleh anggeta Peureute NasDem nyan, haba fiteunah leubeh mangat disipreuk daripada tajak peubeutoi. Maka si Zul han mumada lake meu’ah. Jih haruih roadshow jak peugah bak mandum ureung jih ka difitnah Jokowi.","token_ids":[44,2605,52599,1531,13300,276,16,2122,1468,26160,1702,270,720,393,886,721,6449,636,343,17633,636,343,459,15757,5968,6309,75197,16,698,1733,399,13226,321,2766,321,720,11580,1917,10832,32780,6029,12529,410,131415,687,1492,89,32334,945,636,6687,1733,388,5276,70135,636,375,1531,23950,35116,1723,721,18,186159,38333,1092,873,1607,102338,3956,69,311,2605,361,321,4748,13300,276,19113,171318