é aux photos une vue plus large, où l’on voyait le passage et la place prise par la branche. En les regardant ensemble, j’ai ralenti le geste qui m’avait d’abord paru évident. Le jardin n’était pas une page où chaque trait inattendu devait être corrigé aussitôt. En attendant une réponse, j’ai dégagé le passage sans toucher à la branche. Ce délai m’a permis de remarquer le trajet de la lumière à cet endroit. Peut-être faudra-t-il agir, peut-être changer autre chose. J’aimerais que mes notes conservent la question initiale et le conseil effectivement reçu, afin de ne pas raconter plus tard une décision hésitante comme une évidence que j’aurais toujours connue.","token_ids":[5537,175727,30482,160622,487,26558,661,129402,31416,21104,14501,18,6371,12388,2139,520,175515,15378,368,1556,360,661,188924,16,4594,2094,590,35474,907,2139,8121,661,54007,8121,661,41341,360,12252,77328,18,562,1723,1269,26961,690,9473,3252,92670,524,58027,16,60216,909,282,1723,899,744,11303,661,35719,65469,338,122954,4694,4788,174247,388,46,1723,1269,170419,7885,9473,3788,44094,4171,2927,16,22149,312,1723,267,18027,1556,484,16504,985,661,2111,57990,821,661,175727,18,3470,1955,4345,445,33925,16,477,1723,1269,181345,10296,484,117272,4275,288,1723,392,1556,282,1723,377,567,135000,215866,18,2130,76035,307,228427,1556,3706,3788,2798,22149,32284,20817,297,116398,89,139109,12859,137734,487,58172,279,24035,18,3470,75003,3788,74724,16,477,1723,1269,95521,116107,484,16504,10566,179742,1879,661,175727,18,20150,127444,288,205054,67090,360,87421,11303,484,143463,360,661,76832,1879,26833,123309,18,184328,51946,133301,1327,36284,120168,16,12941,51946,65118,31538,16654,18,562,1723,2203,266,2139,909,5027,10055,12893,303,661,3407,225804,985,484,94760,181547,111367,16,32524,360,590,3706,1167,245077,4171,45007,3788,79388,218045,161034,12028,3788,180439,909,477,1723,5467,2139,29775,158975,18],"tokens":["La","Ġbranche","Ġavait","Ġpouss","Ã©","Ġcontre","Ġla","Ġgrille","Ġpendant","Ġnotre","Ġabsence",".","ĠJe","Ġpens","ais"