e, nraranye omenala nke orcs na onye a dị omimi bụ na Arondir na ọtụtụ ndị ọzọ elves ndị a kpọchiri n'ogige Adar na-eche ma aha ya nwere ike ịbụ okwu ọzọ maka Sauron. Ọ na-arụsi ọrụ ike n'ịhazi nnukwu netwọkụ nke ọwara mmiri dị n'okpuru ala gafee Southlands na ibibi obodo nta mmadụ ọ bụla na-aga n'ụzọ ya. Anyị nwere ike ọ gaghị ama nwoke a n'ihu ọha, mana ọ dị ka ihe doro anya na ọ bụ onye ọjọọ, yana onye nwere ụdị ọrụ gbara ọchịchịrị nke a na-ekpughebeghị.\nMgbe mbọ mgbapụ agbapụ gachara nke ọma, a dọkpụrụ Arondir gaa Adar, mana naanị ntakịrị ntakịrị ihe anyị hụrụ gbasara ọnụ ọgụgụ a ka nwere nnukwu anya. Ọ gaghị ekwe omume ikwu nke agbụrụ Adar bụ n'oge nkenke oge anyị na-ahụ ihu ya, naanị na ọ bụ icha mmirimmiri na kama ogologo ntutu isi ojii. Mana ọ dị ka ihe doro anya na ma ọ bụ mmadụ ma ọ bụ ụdị elf rụrụ arụ, ọ bụghị onye orc.","measurement_context":null,"character_measurement":null,"roundtrip_exact":true},{"id":"fineweb-ig-0066","collection":"dataset/fineweb/ig.jsonl","text":"Enwere ọtụtụ ihe omimi karịa mgbe ha si n'oké osimiri bịa. Ebe ụfọdụ n’ụwa nwere ọmarịcha ihe okike nke a na-agbakwunye na ngwa anya anya nke na-eju ndị niile bịara leta ya anya. Taa, anyị ga-ekwu maka ya Fata Morgana utịp. Mmetụta a pụtara n'ụsọ ụfọdụ ma mee ka onye ọ bụla nwee ike iji anya nke uche hụ ya ikwu okwu.\nN’isiokwu a anyị ga-agwa gị ihe Fata Morgana na-arụ na ihe kpatara ya.\nKedu ihe bụ fata Morgana\nAha nke mmetụta a sitere n'akụkọ ifo nke Eze Arthur. Ọ bụ agwa ochie na akwụkwọ ndị Europe. Eze Arthur nwere ọkara nwanne nwanyị bụ nwanyị mgbaasị nke ikike ya bụ ịgbanwe ọdịdị ya. A maara nzọụkwụ ahụ aha Morgana le Fay, Morgane, Morganna, Morgaine na aha ndị ọzọ. Aha ọ bụla ọ bụ, amaara ya dị ka onye anwansi ma ọ bụ nwanyị mgbaasị nwere ikike anwansi.","token_ids":[3873,48251,225,66289,184119,4918,700,268,4734,15009,19315,93114,8892,1316,3953,2122,307,11,554,487,2580,320,9976,10955,69,18,428,1316,225,4918,74,6006,72,4918,307,1723,4918,5718,307,48251,225,6006,8897,4608,5122,700,