y","a",","," y","ef","ka","-d"," t","array","t"," i"," um","i"," is","ema"," «"," Tay","enk","udt"," »","(","Synchron","ique",")"," ak","ken"," ad"," tt","-y","essem","g","ired"," �","�","ef"," t","array","t"," «"," Taz","ger","k","udt"," »"," (","dia","chron","ique",")"," i"," yell","an"," tett","was","em","ras"," deg"," te","z","raw","in"," ne","�","�"," fell","-as"," i"," y","ud","ds","ent"," te","z","raw","in"," send"," tas","nil","est","."," Taz","raw","t"," tay","enk","udt"," d"," tin"," yell","an"," d"," tur","kid","t"," deg"," wak","ud",","," s"," way","a"," y","ew","we","ḍ"," y","ef","ka","-as"," yi","wen"," w","udem"," gar"," wid"," n"," tuss","na"," tam","ay","nut","."],"ids_available":true,"boundaries_approximate":false,"piece_format":"native_vocabulary_piece","decoded_text":"Nenna-d, d ayen i yessemgarden Tasnilest ɣef tussniwin i yellan zerwent tutlayt send ad d-tesejbu tneggarut-a s tektiwin n F. de Saussure. Amek iga uneggaru-a, akken ad yefk udeg usnan i tezrawt-a, yewwi-d ad as-yefk ittewlen n tussna tamaynut : \"Arkad, Ameẓẓul, akked talɣa tamatut- ɣaf waya i d-yefka tanakta « Tutlayt », akken daɣen i yessemgared gar-as akked « Tameslayt » akked « Asiwel ».\nAkken ad yezrew tutlayt i yellan d tamatut i yellan d tamadwant, yewwi-d ad as-yefk talɣa turkidt imi akken i neẓra tameslayt tettbeddil seg tallit ɣer tayeḍ deg umkan ɣer wayeḍ, deg umdan ɣer wayeḍ (ayen ara nwali deg temsirin-nniḍen) ; ɣef waya, yefka-d tarrayt i umi isema « Tayenkudt »(Synchronique) akken ad tt-yessemgired ɣef tarrayt « Tazgerkudt » (diachronique) i yellan tettwasemras deg tezrawin neɣ fell-as i yuddsent tezrawin send tasnilest. Tazrawt tayenkudt d tin yellan d turkidt deg wakud, s waya yewweḍ yefka-as yiwen wudem gar wid n tussna tamaynut.","measurement_context":null,"character_measurement":null,"roundtrip_exact":true},{"id":"fineweb-kab-0009","collection":"dataset/fineweb/kab.jsonl","text":"Tiddukla\ntadelsant “Asirem” ad teddes “Arraz n tsekla tamazight”, taddart\ntiwriw