," k","oe"," ki"," te"," wh","akam","ahi"," i"," te"," kup","u","hip","a"," hou"," hei"," ur","u"," atu"," ki"," te"," pa","ew","h","iri"," wh","iri","hor","anga"," o"," te"," pou","ara","."],"ids_available":true,"boundaries_approximate":false,"piece_format":"native_vocabulary_piece","decoded_text":"Kei raro nei etahi o nga taputapu ka taea te whakamahi i te wahitau IP 192.168.11:\n- pouara\n- Kāmera Haumaru\n- Pūrere Rokiroki Whatunga (NAS)\n- Nga taputapu whatunga ahokore (whakauru, tukurua, aha atu)\nMe pehea te huri i te kupuhipa Wifi 192.168.1.1\nHei huri i te kupuhipa WiFi (kaore e pohehe ki te kupuhipa kaiwhakahaere pouara) me te wahitau IP 192.168.1.1 whai i enei mahi ngawari:\n- Whakatuwheratia he kaitirotiro paetukutuku ka patohia te wahitau IP 192.168.1.1 i te pae wāhitau.\n- Whakauruhia te ingoa o kaiwhakamahi me te kupuhipa ki te uru atu ki te paewhiri whirihoranga pouara.\n- Rapua he whiringa i te paewhiri whirihoranga o te pouara e pa ana ki te kupuhipa uru me te haumarutanga.\n- Whaia nga tohutohu i runga i te mata hei huri i te kupuhipa uru. (Ko te tikanga ka huri i runga i te waitohu o te pouara)\n- Tiakina nga huringa ka kati i te paewhiri whirihoranga pouara. Mai i tenei wa, ka hiahia koe ki te whakamahi i te kupuhipa hou hei uru atu ki te paewhiri whirihoranga o te pouara.","measurement_context":null,"character_measurement":null,"roundtrip_exact":true},{"id":"fineweb-min-0029","collection":"dataset/fineweb/min.jsonl","text":"Dalam kahidupan sahari-hari, arti nan labiah dan kurang dipahami \"labiah untuak kapantingan pribadi\" dan \"kurang untuak kapantingan umum\" atau kapantingan urang lain. Istilah mode ko tantu bisa dikatoan indak adia, karano indak sasuai jo prinsip keadilan sosial nan balaku dalam masyarakaik Minang. Hal mode iko babeda berbeda jo adaik nan bacupak bagantang yaitu asas nan balandasan prinsip keadilan bagi masyarakaik nan takanduang dalam pancasila yaitu sila kalimo.\nAdaik bacupak bagantang sangaik arek kaitannyo dengan pamimpin. pamimpin di Minangkabau disabuik “urang nan ampek jinih”, yaitu pangulu, manti, malin, dan dubalang. Dari kaampek ko kito baraja mana tau kito manjadi salah satu nyo. Kito hiduik dalam bamasyarakaik tantu punyo pamimpin. Misalnyo apobilo kito manjadi pamimpin di Minangkabau tantunyo kito mampunyoi cupak tasandiri dalam diri kito cupak iko nan paratamu tantunyo cupak usali yaitu cupak yang didasarkan pado diri kito maksudnyo hati kito, kama kato hati itulah nan sabananyo.","token_ids":[44413,73620,47834,26290,731,68083,16,66189,10759,8936,15231,1917,42493,158327,373,18197,15231,1859,89,417,21731,445,82806,63921,6,1917,373,58250,459,1859,89,417,21731,445,82806,33379,6,6861,21731,445,82806,4061,459,10152,18,45862,30808,5432,12231,16222,89,6829,12877,2179,276,998,417,578,546,16,19315,3399,998,417,272,85008,1269,7192,115726,211625,38142,10759,4609,13726,5192,21746,284,8180,550,4336,459,18,15811,5432,7950,83,15940,14490,36248,7192,9086,550,10759,50352,848,417,6121,181146,23658,192893,10759,4609,414,12064,115726,211625,16759,21746,284,8180,550,10759,2666,414,32033,5192,56680,145995,23658,205925,15757,8236,388,36177,550,50352,848,417,6121,181146,8317,74344,436,79,399,1556,982,17633,3491,32717,60035,18,32717,60035,720,4336,17149,377,1212,647,94262,550,4570,101312,10759,861,40403,18726,3189,37349,23658,105505,15872,16,288,7491,16,248908,16,1917,24606,148750,18,54607,9884,319,40403,12231,399,3891,3367,14144,24877,46524,399,3891,719,100473,18063,11462,13300,83,18,623,3891,19048,89,550,5192,110719,8544,284,8180,550,16222,89,6284,17633,32717,60035,18,31761,281,1887,83,1469,643,11996,399,3891,719,100473,32717,60035,720,4336,17149,377,1212,16222,343,17633,399,3891,288,792,88306,4748,12641,417,40479,414,9976,5192,29374,399,3891,12641,417,7950,83,10759,821,271,50945,16222,343,17633,12641,417,471,3526,23658,12641,417,1589,201162,278,1564,29374,399,3891,139888,1887,83,48248,399,3891,16,399,2624,399,2179,48248,88267,10759,12993,276,253861,18],"tokens":["Dalam","Ġkah","idupan","Ġs