aya bakal papisah ti sakola\nieu. Henteu hilaf abdi ngawakilan rerencangan ngahaturkeun rewu nuhun laksaketi\nkabingahan ka bapa sareng ibu guru anu mana tos ngajarkeun ka abdi sadaya loba\nhal. Mugia naon anu diajarkeun ku bapa guru sareng ibu guru ka urang sadaya\ntiasa dimanfaatkeun ka nu hal positif sareng aya manfaatna kanggo nusa, bangsa\nsareng agama.","token_ids":[27274,354,343,13474,4036,4061,459,77523,966,4842,6063,84161,1649,343,278,26842,203,87,531,563,3773,77969,9884,63104,271,24752,106352,18,27360,24877,86626,18589,43104,225,24530,4061,459,14459,5557,203,2170,6468,2470,133217,86626,9884,55783,57670,32193,1723,2631,7216,388,2936,281,27801,4947,66641,102604,288,45301,11125,617,8473,181374,1649,343,9884,203,141933,78,10794,4061,459,14459,5557,109286,39018,126384,16,150594,29546,2631,9884,22012,1292,934,2605,16,119728,1787,421,36508,9884,4061,459,14459,5557,2313,13726,102640,1787,387,89,7854,3145,24752,6377,271,187899,13146,284,982,2605,16,97412,11011,203,301,4458,281,395,5112,388,44,51134,264,14459,5557,387,89,60320,320,79,1305,11242,3189,518,271,421,82,3971,343,1649,343,286,5748,353,1787,103595,2242,583,8425,387,89,2470,105706,16883,58963,745,5423,103595,2242,13300,142839,847,343,203,7362,271,86626,86424,9278,53896,621,20865,8119,59439,2683,617,388,44,3950,89,108954,353,821,110334,2683,617,6377,343,4061,459,265,3145,203,44180,24530,18,27360,24877,265,7394,7170,142651,2313,12299,1787,4061,459,14459,5557,52845,8248,78752,3805,62885,5890,203,24530,18,435,3950,89,29546,2631,583,8425,2470,105706,16883,58963,745,5423,2470,721,5661,1649,343,316,61001,307,3971,343,312,5972,417,39874,203,61994,291,8119,9884,290,6862,40821,563,56193,47828,387,89,24877,123070,2470,1246,100868,343,9884,583,8425,14459,5557,312,16635,203,7337,18,83494,546,1609,267,387,89,166026,100868,343,13683,290,6862,47828,40821,563,56193,47828,9884,4061,459,14459,5557,203,2170,6468,241926,32147,1649,343,9884,5738,3337,57707,40821,563,265,3145,54323,1787,103595,2242,307,22069,16,78024,203,87,531,56