iraa aore ra i ta outou haapiiraa utuafare?","measurement_context":null,"character_measurement":null,"roundtrip_exact":true},{"id":"fineweb-ty-0046","collection":"dataset/fineweb/ty.jsonl","text":"14. E nafea Iehova e tauturu ai ia oe ia tiavaruhia hoê melo o te utuafare?\n14 A feruri na i te tahi atu tupuraa fifi. Peneia‘e ua tiavaruhia hoê melo o to oe utuafare. Ua ite oe eaha ta te Bibilia e parau ra no nia i te feia tei tiavaruhia. (Kor. 1, 5:11; Ioa. 2, 10) No to oe here i tera taata, e mana‘o paha oe e mea fifi mau ia auraro i te faaueraa Bibilia aore ra eita roa ’tu e nehenehe. E tiaturi anei oe e e horoa mai to oe Metua i te ra‘i i te puai no te auraro ia ’na ma te taiva ore? E mana‘o anei oe e ua riro teie tupuraa ei taime no te haafatata ’tu ia Iehova?\n15. No te aha Adamu i faaroo ore ai ia Iehova?\n15 E faaau ana‘e te reira i ta te taata matamua ra o Adamu i rave. Ua tiaturi anei oia e e nehenehe oia e faaroo ore ia Iehova e e ora noa? Aita, “e ere hoi Adamu tei vare.” (Tim. 1, 2:14) No te aha ïa oia i faaroo ore ai ia Iehova? Ua amu Adamu i te maa hotu ta ta ’na vahine i horoa ’tu no te mea ua here rahi a‘e oia i ta ’na vahine i ia Iehova.","token_ids":[992,18,428,1609,147171,342,10735,9036,317,89918,17306,9376,22499,76695,22499,3805,392,33172,546,2768,1307,3929,83,283,813,3917,89,2631,531,1320,992,340,11734,9238,1609,700,813,11120,77,100696,128092,31611,285,10108,18,370,1666,546,33137,73,98488,3805,392,33172,546,2768,1307,3929,83,283,304,76695,3917,89,2631,531,18,559,69,213172,76695,317,11593,6377,813,398,17039,546,317,821,1212,1167,840,307,546,700,813,1004,546,813,77,3805,392,33172,546,18,344,134450,18,225,21,16,225,25,30,807,31,342,22632,18,225,22,16,225,622,13,2523,304,76695,1743,700,2322,69,6377,576,16,317,24877,33137,83,278,11593,76695,317,156956,285,10108,30773,22499,35746,14508,700,813,3850,1212,2659,69,398,17039,546,265,442,1167,317,2757,820,69,108121,15575,317,590,33026,268,18,428,3805,219332,387,31067,76695,317,317,4825,22632,11176,304,76695,